# Local experiments

Do not run probes, comparisons, or one-off tests from `/tmp`, and do not write their scripts or results there.

Put the script and the output in `scratch/` at the repo root. Create that directory if it is missing. It is gitignored, so the trial can stay on disk for inspection without being committed.

The speech path and the unit tests stay as they are until a trial is kept. A result that is discarded leaves the script and the output in `scratch/` rather than disappearing with the temp directory.

```text
# Bad
/tmp/probe_syllable_pause.py

# Good
scratch/syllable-pause.py
scratch/syllable-pause.txt
```
